{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:title","translation":"句法（Syntomic）拓扑（topology）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"标题中的类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节标题；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）的句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）的概念，并定义代数空间（algebraic space）的大（big）句法（syntomic）位点（site）。请与《拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0001> 节比较。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"覆盖与位点类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"本节概念；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"大位点所属对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"大句法位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"本节定义；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041A:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004> 的句法覆盖（syntomic covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，其成员是 <MATH_0006> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），每个 <MATH_0007> 都是句法（syntomic）的，且 <MATH_0008>，即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic covering","target_term":"句法覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic covering","target_term":"句法覆盖","context":"所定义的族；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"成员性质；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射条件；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这与《拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001> 完全相同。特别地，若 <MATH_0001> 和所有 <MATH_0002> 都是概形（schemes），就得到概形（schemes）的通常句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"通常定义；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"覆盖类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"通常覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFB:statement","translation":"任何光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering）都是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering），因而任何平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）更是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"给定覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"几种覆盖关系；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"结论中的覆盖类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"更特殊的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"更特殊的覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFB:proof","translation":"这由定义、光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）是句法（syntomic）的这一事实（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0001>），以及引理 <REF_0002> 显然得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"所用事实；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所用事实；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"所用性质；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节名的词核；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若 <MATH_0004> 是同构（isomorphism），则 <MATH_0005> 是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering），覆盖 <MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若 <MATH_0007> 是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering），且对每个 <MATH_0008> 都有句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，则 <MATH_0010> 是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若 <MATH_0011> 是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering），且 <MATH_0012> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则 <MATH_0013> 是句法（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第一条；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"覆盖类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖公理；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"第三条中的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第三条；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
